{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":13,"ref":"2-chronicles 2:13","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"om","chapter":2,"translation":"Ilmi dubartii tokkoo kan da'ummoota Daaniti, abbaan isaas nama Tsoorii; beeka waan hojjechuu warqii keessaa fi qurxummii keessaa, lukkuuttaa keessaa, sibiila keessaa, dhagaa keessaa fi muka keessaa, Argamaan keessaa, Tikeelet keessaa fi Buuts keessaa fi Karmiil keessaa; akkasumas wuuga hunda wuuguuf, yaaddoo hunda yaaduuf — waan isaatti kennameef, ogeeyota kee wajjiniifi ogeeyota Adoonaay kiyya Daawid abbaa kee wajjin.","tokens":[{"surface":"בן","gloss":"ilmi"},{"surface":"אשה","gloss":"dubartii"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"kan"},{"surface":"בנות","gloss":"da'ummoota"},{"surface":"דן","gloss":"Daan"},{"surface":"ואביו","gloss":"abbaan isaas"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"nama"},{"surface":"צרי","gloss":"Tsoorii"},{"surface":"יודע","gloss":"beeka"},{"surface":"לעשות","gloss":"waan hojjechuu"},{"surface":"בזהב","gloss":"warqii keessaa"},{"surface":"ובכסף","gloss":"fi qurxummii keessaa"},{"surface":"בנחשת","gloss":"lukkuuttaa keessaa"},{"surface":"בברזל","gloss":"sibiila keessaa"},{"surface":"באבנים","gloss":"dhagaa keessaa"},{"surface":"ובעצים","gloss":"fi muka keessaa"},{"surface":"בארגמן","gloss":"Argamaan keessaa"},{"surface":"בתכלת","gloss":"Tikeelet keessaa"},{"surface":"ובבוץ","gloss":"fi Buuts keessaa"},{"surface":"ובכרמיל","gloss":"fi Karmiil keessaa"},{"surface":"ולפתח","gloss":"wuuguuf"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"hunda"},{"surface":"פתוח","gloss":"wuuga"},{"surface":"ולחשב","gloss":"yaaduuf"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"hunda"},{"surface":"מחשבת","gloss":"yaaddoo"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"waan"},{"surface":"ינתן","gloss":"kennameef"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"isaatti"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"wajjin"},{"surface":"חכמיך","gloss":"ogeeyota kee"},{"surface":"וחכמי","gloss":"fi ogeeyota"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adoonaay kiyya"},{"surface":"דויד","gloss":"Daawid"},{"surface":"אביך","gloss":"abbaa kee"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-29T17:05:47.551830361Z","mod